-- The topologically-EARLIER module.  `Zed` is `public export`, so it survives
-- `publicDataDecls` and lands in the field-owner seed of every LATER module in the
-- graph -- including `bmod.mdk`, which does not import it and cannot name it.
--
-- 🚨 DO NOT RENAME `tag`.  The collision with `bmod`'s `Wye.tag` IS the fixture;
-- rename it and `main.mdk` checks clean for the wrong reason.
public export data Zed = Zed { tag : String }
